{"id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-degree-structure.md","title":"Degrees of Extensions of a Fixed Arithmetic Base","display":"df-degree-structure — Degrees of Extensions of a Fixed Arithmetic Base","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-degree-structure","aliases":["67-df-degree-structure"],"display":"df-degree-structure — Degrees of Extensions of a Fixed Arithmetic Base","depends_on":["[[67-df-interpretability]]","[[67-df-interpretability-degree]]","[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]","[[67-df-PA]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_chapter":"7","source_section":"§1","source_label":"chapter-opening definitions and bottom/top paragraph","source_printed_pages":[94,95],"source_pdf_pages":[105,106],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-degree-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-degree-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-degree-structure — Degrees of Extensions of a Fixed Arithmetic Base"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83526f6eba0eb8e2\" href=\"?note=83526f6eba0eb8e2\" title=\"67-df-interpretability-degree\">67-df-interpretability-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" href=\"?note=ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"chapter-opening definitions and bottom/top paragraph"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>94</span><span>95</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>105</span><span>106</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定一阶算术语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_A\">\\(L_A\\)</span> 及其句子集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 是固定矛盾句。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 采用固定原始递归公理集呈现（从而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}(T)\\)</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\nvdash\\bot\">\\(T\\nvdash\\bot\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}\\)</span> 是公理集的递归可枚举性，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" href=\"?note=ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd\">\\(\\unlhd\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"83526f6eba0eb8e2\" href=\"?note=83526f6eba0eb8e2\" title=\"67-df-interpretability-degree\">67-df-interpretability-degree</a>；不要求扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 一致。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span> 对公理集表示并集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A+\\varphi=A\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\">\\(A+\\varphi=A\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\">\\(\\leq_T\\)</span> 是二元关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_T\">\\(d_T\\)</span> 的定义域为下面构造的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ext}(T)\">\\(\\mathsf{Ext}(T)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ext}(T)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{REAx}(A)\\land T\\subseteq A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ext}(T)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{REAx}(A)\\land T\\subseteq A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d_T(A)\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathsf{Ext}(T):A\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}B\\}\\qquad(A\\in\\mathsf{Ext}(T)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d_T(A)\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathsf{Ext}(T):A\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}B\\}\\qquad(A\\in\\mathsf{Ext}(T)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_T\\coloneqq\\{d_T(A):A\\in\\mathsf{Ext}(T)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_T\\coloneqq\\{d_T(A):A\\in\\mathsf{Ext}(T)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\\ \\coloneqq\\{(d_T(A),d_T(B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ext}(T)\\land A\\unlhd B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\leq_T\\ \\coloneqq\\{(d_T(A),d_T(B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ext}(T)\\land A\\unlhd B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a&lt;_Tb\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad(a\\leq_Tb\\land a\\ne b)\\qquad(a,b\\in D_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a&lt;_Tb\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad(a\\leq_Tb\\land a\\ne b)\\qquad(a,b\\in D_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0_T\\coloneqq d_T(T),\\qquad\\mathbf1_T\\coloneqq d_T(T+\\bot),\\qquad\\mathbf D_T\\coloneqq(D_T,\\leq_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf0_T\\coloneqq d_T(T),\\qquad\\mathbf1_T\\coloneqq d_T(T+\\bot),\\qquad\\mathbf D_T\\coloneqq(D_T,\\leq_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书第7章开篇（印刷94页，PDF105页）的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_T\">\\(D_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(A)\">\\(d(A)\\)</span> 与度序。旧版任意“chosen class”不足以承接本章格、密度等结论；现固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 的一个一致可有效公理化扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的全部可有效公理化扩张。包括不一致扩张，才能有原书印刷95页的最大度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_T\">\\(\\mathbf1_T\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>原书第1章印刷10–11页（PDF21–22页）用 Craig 定理把 r.e. 理论换成演绎等价的原始递归公理化；这里保留 r.e. 公理集载体，得到相同的度：对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\supseteq T\">\\(A\\supseteq T\\)</span> 取 Craig 给出的 PR 理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\cup T\">\\(Y\\cup T\\)</span> 仍为 PR 且与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 演绎等价。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_T(A)\">\\(d_T(A)\\)</span> 是集合而非任选代表元；传递性使度序不依赖代表元。所有集合都在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A})\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A})\\)</span> 内取，未量化全宇宙理论真类。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-interpretability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretability-degree","status":"resolved","id":"83526f6eba0eb8e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-interpretability-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 采用固定原始递归公理集呈现（从而 $\\mathrm{REAx}(T)$），$\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T$，$T\\nvdash\\bot$；$\\mathrm{REAx}$ 是公理集的递归可枚举性，见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]；$\\mathrm{PA}$ 见 [[67-df-PA]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 采用固定原始递归公理集呈现（从而 $\\mathrm{REAx}(T)$），$\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T$，$T\\nvdash\\bot$；$\\mathrm{REAx}$ 是公理集的递归可枚举性，见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]；$\\mathrm{PA}$ 见 [[67-df-PA]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\unlhd$ 见 [[67-df-interpretability]]，$\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}$ 见 [[67-df-interpretability-degree]]；不要求扩张 $A$ 一致。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretability-degree","status":"resolved","id":"83526f6eba0eb8e2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\unlhd$ 见 [[67-df-interpretability]]，$\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}$ 见 [[67-df-interpretability-degree]]；不要求扩张 $A$ 一致。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REAx}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"T\\nvdash\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REAx}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\unlhd","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"A+\\varphi=A\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_T","display":false},{"tex":"d_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ext}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ext}(T)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{REAx}(A)\\land T\\subseteq A\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"d_T(A)\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathsf{Ext}(T):A\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}B\\}\\qquad(A\\in\\mathsf{Ext}(T)).","display":true},{"tex":"D_T\\coloneqq\\{d_T(A):A\\in\\mathsf{Ext}(T)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\leq_T\\ \\coloneqq\\{(d_T(A),d_T(B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ext}(T)\\land A\\unlhd B\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"a<_Tb\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad(a\\leq_Tb\\land a\\ne b)\\qquad(a,b\\in D_T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf0_T\\coloneqq d_T(T),\\qquad\\mathbf1_T\\coloneqq d_T(T+\\bot),\\qquad\\mathbf D_T\\coloneqq(D_T,\\leq_T).","display":true},{"tex":"D_T","display":false},{"tex":"d(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_T","display":false},{"tex":"A\\supseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\cup T","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"d_T(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A})","display":false}],"bytes":2954,"backlinks":[{"id":"511859971a231477","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D_T,\\leq_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$G\\subseteq D_T$，$c\\in D_T$。"},{"id":"7ee1f80d5a223006","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D_T,\\leq_T,<_T,\\mathbf1_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$G\\subseteq D_T$，$P\\subseteq D_T$。"},{"id":"73717706953334f5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,D_T,d_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$\\Phi$ 是 $L_A$ 公式的任意给定集合，$\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 为句子集。"},{"id":"dd5d746ea1792bf7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\leq_T,<_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$\\wedge_T,\\vee_T$ 采用 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]。"},{"id":"0b5840b17b35f1e7","anch